<HEAD>Records to be Kept by Employers</HEAD>
<DIV8 N="794.144" TYPE="SECTION" hierarchy_metadata="{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/on/_SUBSTITUTE_DATE_/title-29/section-794.144&quot;,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;29 CFR 794.144&quot;}">
<HEAD>&#xA7; 794.144 Records to be maintained.</HEAD>
<P>(a) <I>Form of records.</I> No particular order or form of records is prescribed by the recordkeeping regulations (part 516 of this chapter). Every employer operating under section 7(b)(3) of the Act is, however, required to maintain and preserve records containing the information and data as set out in &#xA7;&#xA7; 516.2 and 516.21 of this chapter.</P>
